  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61209271), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%9B%90%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%98-%EB%A7%88%EB%B2%95%EC%82%AC/3311)\n\nIn the Joseon Dynasty, indecency was forbidden.\n\nThe people of 'Seoyeon', who were newly appointed as judges of the southern island, serve the serpent.\n\nsilver\n\nIt is said that every year a person is sacrificed.\n\nEnraged at this absurd remark, Yeon goes to the snake's den, but is attacked by a giant serpent living there. In front of him, a woman who was sacrificed to the serpent appears and uses magic to defeat the serpent.\n\nthug, thug.\n\n'......Is it a person?'\n\nInside the cave where the serpent's body falls, Yeon looks at the woman who saved him as if possessed. The woman's red hair fills Yeon's eyes.\n\nMaybe.... I think it was from this time.",
